# =============================================================================
# CURSORIGNORE.master — bản mẫu dùng chung mọi dự án
# =============================================================================
# Mục đích: chặn Cursor index/đọc secrets, key, dump PII, dependency/build ồn.
#
# Cách dùng:
#   1. Copy file này thành `.cursorignore` ở ROOT repo (cạnh .gitignore)
#      cp /path/to/CURSORIGNORE.master /path/to/repo/.cursorignore
#   2. Tuỳ project: bỏ comment / thêm dòng ở cuối (section PROJECT-SPECIFIC)
#   3. Reload Cursor window (Developer: Reload Window)
#
# Cú pháp = gitignore. Dòng `!` (un-ignore) phải nằm SAU pattern chặn.
# Giữ template an toàn: .env.sample / .env.example / .env.default / *.yml.enc
#
# Canonical:
#   senior-workflow-kit/templates/CURSORIGNORE.master
# Mirrors (cùng nội dung):
#   port_jp/CURSORIGNORE.master
#   Documents/workspace/CURSORIGNORE.master
#   Documents/workspaces/CURSORIGNORE.master
# =============================================================================

# --- Env / dotenv / direnv ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.sample
!.env.example
!.env.default
.envrc
.envrc.*
!.envrc.example
!.envrc.development

# --- Rails / encrypted credentials ---
**/config/master.key
**/master.key
**/config/credentials/*.key
**/config/credentials/*.yml
!**/config/credentials/*.yml.enc
**/config/credentials.yml.enc
**/secrets.yml
**/config/secrets.yml

# --- Private keys / certs / cloud IAM ---
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*_rsa
**/id_rsa
**/id_ed25519
**/*.keystore
**/service-account*.json
**/*-service-account.json
**/google-credentials.json
**/application_default_credentials.json
**/firebase-adminsdk*.json
**/.aws/credentials
**/keys.txt
**/age/keys.txt
**/*.agekey

# --- Local Docker / Compose overrides (machine ports) ---
docker-compose.override.yml
compose.override.yml
compose.*.override.yml

# --- DB dumps / local DB files (often PII) ---
**/*.sql
**/*.sql.gz
**/*.dump
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.sqlite3-journal

# --- Runtime / uploads / logs ---
**/storage/**
**/public/uploads/**
**/public/system/**
**/log/**
**/tmp/**
**/uploads/**

# --- Dependencies / build / caches ---
**/node_modules/**
**/vendor/bundle/**
**/vendor/cache/**
**/.bundle/**
**/public/packs/**
**/public/assets/**
**/coverage/**
**/.next/**
**/dist/**
**/build/**
**/out/**
**/.turbo/**
**/.cache/**
**/__pycache__/**
**/.venv/**
**/venv/**
**/target/**
**/.terraform/**
**/.terragrunt-cache/**

# --- Mobile / native (optional noise) ---
**/Pods/**
**/*.xcuserdata/**
**/DerivedData/**

# --- VCS / OS / editor junk ---
**/.git/**
**/.svn/**
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/*.swp
**/*~

# =============================================================================
# PROJECT-SPECIFIC (bỏ comment / thêm dưới đây theo repo)
# =============================================================================
# # Large fixtures / recorded traffic
# # **/fixtures/cassettes/**
# # **/spec/vcr_cassettes/**
#
# # Data science / notebooks output
# # **/*.ipynb_checkpoints/**
# # **/data/raw/**
#
# # Un-ignore a template you need agent to read
# # !.envrc.something
